# Marcel, Split-Soul Artist

> Marcel is a roaming support who wins by turning one chokepoint into a kill box. His value is conditional, not constant: he needs a doorway both teams have to fight through and a carry who can convert his freeze into damage. Pick him to pin a fight in place, never to start a dive.

