## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor Control (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when enemy crowd control is light and Marcel needs faster bush checks before the first Turtle setup.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn that tags Marcel before he can walk into Platinum Snap range.; Antique Cuirass over Athena's Shield when Use when physical skill burst from the EXP laner or jungler is the threat that breaks Marcel before Golden Hour.; Flask of the Oasis over Athena's Shield when Use only with coordinated backline partners who consistently stand close enough to receive Marcel's passive shield.
- Total cost: 10660 gold

Default ranked roam setup that rushes Thunder Belt for passive-proc stacks, then uses Favor and Oracle to turn Marcel's shield windows into real peel.

### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Thunder Belt, Fleeting Time, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Fleeting Time, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when layered crowd control will punish every failed Conceal entry before Marcel can recast Tracking Shot.; Dominance Ice over Fleeting Time when Use when enemy sustain or attack-speed pressure must be checked before ultimate reset value matters.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use when one magic burst combo decides whether Marcel survives long enough to drop Golden Hour.; Guardian Helmet over Antique Cuirass when Use when Marcel wins vision but has to reset HP between repeated Lord dances without recalling.
- Total cost: 10770 gold

Tempo pickoff setup for squads that can follow Conceal, Petrify, and Golden Hour with delayed projectiles instead of asking Marcel to solo-start fights.

### Roam Anti-Basic Frontline (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Chastise Pauldron, Blade Armor, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Chastise Pauldron
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the marksman is protected by enough magic control that raw physical armor no longer covers the first contact.; Oracle over Blade Armor when Use when Marcel needs stronger passive shields more than reflected basic-attack punishment.; Athena's Shield over Blade Armor when Use when burst magic is the actual finisher after Marcel soaks the marksman's opening hits.; Favor over Encourage when Use as the roam blessing when your carry needs extra sustain more than grouped stat sharing.
- Total cost: 10680 gold

Anti-basic setup for front-to-back games where Marcel must stand between his carry and a basic-attack core while Vengeance buys time for the team to fire back.

